---
mm: 1.2
kind: module
name: zero-led
module: platform.zero.led
use: mm.led
use: mm.led.ws2812b
use: mm.mcu
file: led.cppm
option: buildable-host no
---

# platform.zero.led

The Zero boards' WS2812B: one LED, its data input on GP16, driven by mm.mcu
pulse instance zero. It owns the wiring and the one-LED frame, and registers
the controller as mm.led. rp2040_zero and rp2350_zero both bind it.
